    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "o_vehaamar_ulla_ben_zakkai",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "מכלל דרב כהנא ורב אסי צלע בלא חוליא אמרי, ואמר להו גיסטרא קאמריתו? והאמר עולא, בן זכאי אמר: נעקרו -- ברוב צד אחד!",
     "against": "p_rav_gistra",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_michlal_sheela_belo_chulya",
     "gloss_en": "stam: it follows that Rav Kahana and Rav Asi asked about [ribs] without the vertebra"
    }
   ]
  },
  "11": {
   "segId": "Chullin.52a.12",
   "sugya": "chullin_52a_neekru_tzlaot",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_zeh_keneged_zeh",
     "gloss_en": "אמר לך: התם זה שלא כנגד זה, הכא זה כנגד זה (= p_bz_shelo_keneged, p_rav_keneged)",
