    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "o_liveu_kidrav",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "וליבעו מיניה כדרב? -- then let them ask him about Rav's case [one rib]!",
     "against": "p_sheela_tzela_mikan_umikan",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_chada_defarish_tarti",
     "gloss_en": "סברי: ליבעי מיניה חדא דפריש לן תרתי (= p_sevari_chada_tarti)",
     "answers": "o_liveu_kidrav",
     "restores": "p_sheela_tzela_mikan_umikan"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_sevari_chada_tarti",
     "gloss_en": "they reasoned: let us ask him one thing that explains two to us; for if we ask about one and he says tereifa, all the more so two, but if he says fit we still need to ask about two"
    }
   ]
  },
  "16": {
   "segId": "Chullin.52a.17",
   "sugya": "chullin_52a_neekru_tzlaot",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "o_hashta_nami",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "אי הכי, השתא נמי דקא בעי מיניה תרתי, הניחא אי אמר להו כשרה -- כל שכן חדא; ואי אמר להו טרפה -- אכתי חדא מיבעיא להו",
     "against": "p_sevari_chada_tarti",
     "state": "answered"
    }
   ]
  },
  "17": {
   "segId": "Chullin.52a.18",
   "sugya": "chullin_52a_neekru_tzlaot",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_mirtach_ratach",
     "gloss_en": "סברי: אם כן מירתח קא רתח -- חדא טרפה, תרתי מיבעיא? (= p_sevari_mirtach)",
     "answers": "o_hashta_nami",
     "restores": "p_sevari_chada_tarti"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_sevari_mirtach",
     "gloss_en": "they reasoned: if so [one is tereifa], he would become angry -- one is tereifa, and two you ask?"
    }
   ]
  },
  "18": {
